{"id":"torrey:power-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Power Of Christ, The","slug":"power-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"As the Son of God, is the power of God — Joh 5:17-19; 10:28-30.","refs":[["John",5,17,5,19],["John",10,28,10,30]]},{"text":"As man, is from the Father — Ac 10:38.","refs":[["Acts",10,38,10,38]]},{"text":"Supreme. — Eph 1:20,21; 1Pe 3:22.","refs":[["Eph",1,20,1,20],["Eph",1,21,1,21],["1Pet",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Unlimited. — Mt 28:18.","refs":[["Matt",28,18,28,18]]},{"text":"Over all flesh. — Joh 17:2.","refs":[["John",17,2,17,2]]},{"text":"Over all things. — Joh 3:35; Eph 1:22.","refs":[["John",3,35,3,35],["Eph",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"Glorious. — 2Th 1:9.","refs":[["2Thess",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Everlasting. — 1Ti 6:16.","refs":[["1Tim",6,16,6,16]]},{"text":"Is able to subdue all things — Php 3:21.","refs":[["Phil",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Creation. — Joh 1:3,10; Col 1:16.","refs":[["John",1,3,1,3],["John",1,10,1,10],["Col",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Upholding all things. — Col 1:17; Heb 1:3.","refs":[["Col",1,17,1,17],["Heb",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Salvation. — Isa 63:1; Heb 7:25.","refs":[["Isa",63,1,63,1],["Heb",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"His teaching. — Mt 7:28,29; Lu 4:32.","refs":[["Matt",7,28,7,28],["Matt",7,29,7,29],["Luke",4,32,4,32]]},{"text":"Working miracles. — Mt 8:27; Lu 5:17.","refs":[["Matt",8,27,8,27],["Luke",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Enabling others to work miracles. — Mt 10:1; Mr 16:17,18; Lu 10:17.","refs":[["Matt",10,1,10,1],["Mark",16,17,16,17],["Mark",16,18,16,18],["Luke",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"Forgiving sins. — Mt 9:6; Ac 5:31.","refs":[["Matt",9,6,9,6],["Acts",5,31,5,31]]},{"text":"Giving spiritual life. — Joh 5:21,25,26.","refs":[["John",5,21,5,21],["John",5,25,5,25],["John",5,26,5,26]]},{"text":"Giving eternal life. — Joh 17:2.","refs":[["John",17,2,17,2]]},{"text":"Raising the dead. — Joh 5:28,29.","refs":[["John",5,28,5,28],["John",5,29,5,29]]},{"text":"Raising himself from the dead. — Joh 2:19-21; 10:18.","refs":[["John",2,19,2,21],["John",10,18,10,18]]},{"text":"Overcoming the world. — Joh 16:33.","refs":[["John",16,33,16,33]]},{"text":"Overcoming Satan. — Col 2:15; Heb 2:14.","refs":[["Col",2,15,2,15],["Heb",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Destroying the works of Satan. — 1Jo 3:8.","refs":[["1John",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Ministers should make known — 2Pe 1:16.","refs":[["2Pet",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Made willingly by. — Ps 110:3.","refs":[["Ps",110,3,110,3]]},{"text":"Helped by. — Heb 2:18.","refs":[["Heb",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Strengthened by. — Php 4:13; 2Ti 4:17.","refs":[["Phil",4,13,4,13],["2Tim",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Preserved by. — 2Ti 1:12; 4:18.","refs":[["2Tim",1,12,1,12],["2Tim",4,18,4,18]]},{"text":"Bodies of, shall be changed by. — Php 3:21.","refs":[["Phil",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Rests upon saints — 2Co 12:9.","refs":[["2Cor",12,9,12,9]]},{"text":"Present in the assembly of saints — 1Co 5:4.","refs":[["1Cor",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"Shall be specially manifested at his second coming — Mr 13:26; 2Pe 1:16.","refs":[["Mark",13,26,13,26],["2Pet",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Shall subdue all power — 1Co 15:24.","refs":[["1Cor",15,24,15,24]]},{"text":"The wicked shall be destroyed by — Ps 2:9; Isa 11:4; 63:3; 2Th 1:9.","refs":[["Ps",2,9,2,9],["Isa",11,4,11,4],["Isa",63,3,63,3],["2Thess",1,9,1,9]]}],"refCount":60}
